flowchart TD
  accTitle: Architect engagement lifecycle
  accDescr: An architect creates an engagement, records assessment evidence, reviews deterministic findings, plans deep dives, generates a report, and exports a portable archive.
  A[Create engagement] --> B[Quick assessment]
  B --> C[Review gates and findings]
  C --> D[Plan deep dives]
  D --> E[Generate report]
  E --> F[Export portable archive]
  F --> G[Import and reopen]
  G --> E
